meta {
  name: Get All Driver
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/driver
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get All Driver

  This request is used to get all driver. This request interacts with the MySQL database, has a protected routes, and a pagination.

  ## Responses

  **200 — Driver fetched successfully.** Ordered in ascending order by `created_at`
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "driver fetched",
    "data": {
      "data": [
        {
          "id": "6f59235e-c398-8a83-2f95-3f1fbe95ca6e",
          "username": "jhondoe",
          "fullname": "Jhon Doe",
          "telegram_user_id": "123456789",
          "telegram_is_valid": 1,
          "email": "jhondoe@gmail.com",
          "phone": "08123456780",
          "total_trip": 10,
          "notes": "Lorem ipsum",
          "created_at": "2024-09-20 22:53:47",
          "updated_at": "2024-09-21 09:15:12"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — driver failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "driver not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}